  "observations": [
    "The actual SipAdapter now retains a bounded sticky Pending/Answered/Terminal signaling snapshot from creation of every outbound route. It updates under the existing exact route-epoch/mapping and route-state fences, before staged/public event publication and before an initial context can be installed. Only actual Connected mapped from coordinator CallAnswered records an answer; progress, SDP and negotiated codec metadata cannot do so. Terminal is irreversible under delayed or duplicate answers. This is transport resource observation, not current host authorization or durable settlement.",
    "SipInitialParticipantContext.wait_answered has an explicit Tokio deadline, host cancellation, original preparation cancellation and route cancellation. Timeout/cancellation consumes no answer; an atomic claim permits only one successful opaque SipInitialAnswer per exact context. The non-Clone fact carries the actual Connection and SIP Call-ID with redacted Debug, weak context ownership and an exact-incarnation resource-current check. It neither dials nor retries signaling. The host may retain the same captured fact for metadata settlement; lost in-memory facts are not claimed durably recoverable.",
    "Initial prepare_media_controller now refuses unless an actual answer has been captured and the route remains answered/current. Its existing fresh held host media policy and exact outbound-binding controller checks remain required. Capturing an answer does not accept another identity through an administrative Session command, authorize a context export, prove decoded media or confirm physical cleanup.",
    "Three actual numeric-loopback UDP SIP fixtures cover an immediate answer and a delayed answer preceded by a real 180 Ringing. Delayed setup proves a real180cannot finish activation or invoke its media callback. After the peer final200, setup first refuses media initialization before answer capture, rejects cancelled and expired-deadline capture without consuming the observed answer, then successfully captures it. The two successful fixtures refuse a second capture, match the captured SIP Call-ID against the actual activation receipt and wire dialog, install the guarded PCMU controller, admit once, refuse replay/redial/raw media, and invalidate the retained answer/context after one owned BYE dialog cleanup. Timeout/cancellation and pre-answer refusal leave the later valid setup usable. A third actual peer sends 486 Busy Here after ringing; admission fails, no answer is minted, the Core slot is released after confirmed local cleanup, no Session binding survives, and no BYE dialog is invented.",
    "The unchanged selected regression lanes include Service/server units, signed/HTTP Session lifecycle, all9public AI supervision/startup/discovery cases, privateAI own-caller/context/return/restart, and existing actual telephone PCMU movement/old-authority/route-loss. The telephone movement regression is separate from initial calling and is not substituted for an initial decoded multiparty audio proof."
  ],
